            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PASS WHEN · the unresolved call keeps `self Client` and shows one `?` on each empty row, and the projection titles itself ObjectRecord with rows `.object_id` and `.pose.translation.x` — no `?` anywhere on it, and one row for the chain."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "adbs6",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 1080,
